{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40849","headline":"题兴化高田院桥亭 · 郑良士","name":"题兴化高田院桥亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到此溪亭上，浮生始觉非。\n野僧还惜别，游客亦忘归。\n月满千岩静，风清一磬微。\n何时脱尘役，杖履愿相依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}